0h4cTBqRGtYaw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-25","zh":"杜邦德內穆爾 (DD) 股價上漲 72% 後是否已完全定價？"},{"title":"Brookmont Capital Management Acquires 23,581 Shares of DuPont de Nemours, Inc. $DD","src":"MarketBeat","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-25","zh":"Brookmont Capital Management 收購 DuPont de Nemours, Inc. 23,581 股股票 $DD"},{"title":"343,162 DuPont de Nemours, Inc. $DD Shares Sold by Mondrian Investment Partners LTD","src":"MarketBeat","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-25","zh":"Mondrian Investment Partners LTD 出售 343,162 股 DuPont de Nemours, Inc. $DD 股票"},{"title":"DuPont De Nemours (DD) Expands Bioprocessing Tools, Is The Stock Still Cheap?","src":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxNZUFPZ1N5QTRHRG1tanllU1pYWFhZUS1EWjBIM3V4ZXlqamVPX19GVXJoYlFMbDVfSVlNdXNwTUdLbDVwSWMwZlQ3VVc2VkVza1c0bjc5LXlNcTl4dXdVQlVieWRVb09jdGtKMmNLbm9zR0hlVVQ1RGtBWDZlTWNVLVo1eHFxbS1vMzJPbF9vS0VzS243dUp2RDg3Z2pkQUtTMzRVUzB6VQ?oc=5","date":"2026-10-24","zh":"杜邦德內穆爾 (DD) 擴大生物加工工具，股票還便宜嗎？"},{"title":"Quadrant Capital Group LLC Acquires 8,922 Shares of DuPont de Nemours, Inc. $DD","src":"MarketBeat","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-23","zh":"Quadrant Capital Group LLC 收購 DuPont de Nemours, Inc. 8,922 股股票 $DD"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":2},{"name":"併購","count":2},{"name":"能源/電力","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-17","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1666700/000166670026000013/dd-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Throughout this Annual Report on Form 10-K, except as otherwise noted by the context, the terms \"DuPont\" or \"Company\" used herein mean DuPont de Nemours, Inc. and its consolidated subsidiaries.","zh":"在本 10-K 表格年度報告中，除非上下文另有說明，本文中使用的術語「杜邦」或「公司」是指杜邦 de Nemours, Inc. 及其合併子公司。"},{"en":"DuPont is a leading provider of advanced solutions that improve everyday life across healthcare, water, construction and industrial markets. The Company is committed to helping customers advance their technology pipelines and provide solutions that address their unique challenges. From delivering clean water to enabling medical packaging solutions which enhance safety and performance, DuPont's innovations power the essential products and technologies people rely on every day. At December 31, 2025, the Company has subsidiaries in about 50 countries worldwide and manufacturing operations in about 20 countries. See Note 23 to the Consolidated Financial Statements for details on the location of the Company's sales and property.","zh":"杜邦是先進解決方案的領先供應商，致力於改善醫療保健、水務、建築和工業市場的日常生活。該公司致力於幫助客戶推進其技術管道並提供解決方案來應對其獨特的挑戰。從提供清潔水到提高安全性和性能的醫療包裝解決方案，杜邦的創新為人們每天依賴的基本產品和技術提供動力。截至2025年12月31日，該公司在全球約50個國家擁有子公司，並在約20個國家擁有製造業務。有關本公司銷售及物業所在地的詳細資訊，請參閱合併財務報表附註23。"},{"en":"DuPont is a Delaware corporation formed in 2015 (formerly, DowDuPont Inc.), for the purpose of effecting the all-stock merger of equals transactions between The Dow Chemical Company (\"TDCC\") and E. I. du Pont de Nemours and Company (n/k/a as EIDP, Inc., \"EIDP\"), which became effective on August 31, 2017. As a result of the merger, TDCC and EIDP became subsidiaries of DowDuPont Inc. (the \"DWDP Merger\"). The DWDP Merger aimed to combine the strengths of both companies and then realign the assets to create three more focused and streamlined public companies.","zh":"杜邦公司是一家於 2015 年在特拉華州成立的公司（原陶氏杜邦公司），旨在實現陶氏化學公司（“TDCC”）與 E. I. du Pont de Nemours and Company（前稱 EIDP, Inc.，“EIDP”）之間的全股票平等交易合併，該合併於 2017 年 8 月 31 日生效。合併後，TDCC 和 EIDP成為陶氏杜邦公司的子公司（「DWDP 合併」）。 DWDP 合併旨在結合兩家公司的優勢，然後重新調整資產，創建三家更專注和精簡的上市公司。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"The markets in which the Company participates are served by a variety of competitors including multinational companies with significant sales, marketing, research, and financial capabilities, as well as well-established regional companies. Within these markets, competition is driven by product innovation, technological advancement, sustainable practices, pricing strategies, customer services and a changing regulatory landscape. The Company provides its customers with extensive support and technical and testing services, in addition to new product development informed by specific industry technological, sustainability and regulatory needs and evolving customer demands. The Company believes that its proprietary product and process technologies, robust product and application development pipelines, well-known brands, customer intimacy, global manufacturing capability, and local service capa","zh":"公司參與的市場由各種競爭對手提供服務，包括具有強大銷售、行銷、研究和財務能力的跨國公司，以及成熟的區域公司。在這些市場中，競爭是由產品創新、技術進步、永續實踐、定價策略、客戶服務和不斷變化的監管環境所推動的。除了根據特定行業技術、永續性和監管需求以及不斷變化的客戶需求進行新產品開發之外，該公司還為其客戶提供廣泛的支援以及技術和測試服務。公司相信其專有的產品和工藝技術、強大的產品和應用開發管道、知名品牌、客戶親密度、全球製造能力和本地服務能力"},{"en":"The Company uses a wide variety of raw materials in the manufacturing of products. The prices of raw materials, including the price of energy, are driven by global supply and demand. In recent years, raw material prices and availability have been affected by worldwide economic conditions, including supply chain disruptions and inflationary cost pressures. The Company actively works to mitigate impacts of such conditions.","zh":"該公司在產品製造中使用多種原料。包括能源價格在內的原物料價格由全球供需驅動。近年來，原物料價格和供應量受到全球經濟狀況的影響，包括供應鏈中斷和通膨成本壓力。公司積極努力減輕此類情況的影響。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Diversified Industrials","val":3616000000,"zh":"多元化產業部門"},{"name":"Healthcare & Water Technologies","val":3233000000,"zh":"醫療保健和水技術部門"}],"total":6849000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":3188000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":1640000000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"EMEA","val":1468000000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲地區"},{"name":"CN","val":708000000,"zh":"中國"},{"name":"Latin America","val":326000000,"zh":"拉丁美洲"},{"name":"CA","val":227000000,"zh":"加拿大"}],"total":6849000000}},"peers":["DOW","MMM","AA","HON","IP"]}}